# Repurposing Bay (CR 202.3): Bot1 taps Sol Ring for {C}{C} first, then activates the Bay paying that mana and sacrificing the tapped Sol
# Ring (mana value 1), so the search is for an artifact of mana value 2: Mind Stone or Cranial Plating (either is found; Bot1 takes
# Cranial Plating, and the Ornithopter, mana value 0, and a second Sol Ring, mana value 1, are not choices - refusals). The cost
# paid with mana already made is allowed because mana abilities may be activated before the cost (CR 601.2g, 602.2b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Repurposing Bay
Mox Pearl
Island
Cranial Plating
Mind Stone
Ornithopter
Sol Ring
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

